Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Try a robust median combination on the full pool to see if it beats the mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if removing extremes improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test whether the single best model ETS alone outperforms the mean combination.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ETS"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled meta‑model handle (w1) on the full pool to see if a learned weighting improves over the best single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated adaptive weighting improves over the best_single ETS.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test whether the best single model catboost outperforms ETS and provides a better robust baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the smaller pool1 to see if a focused weighted mix improves over mean/median on that subset.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination on a smaller, potentially more stable pool (pool1) to see if restricting to the top correlated models improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a smaller, more stable subset improves over ETS alone.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean on the smaller pool2 to see if removing extremes improves over best_single ETS.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool2","trim_pct":0.2}

